  "title": "PIM-STM: Software Transactional Memory for Processing-In-Memory Systems",
  "abstract": "Processing-In-Memory (PIM) is a novel approach that augments existing DRAM memory chips with lightweight logic. By allowing to offload computations to the PIM system, this architecture allows for circumventing the data-bottleneck problem that affects many modern workloads.",
